 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Mipurei no Otome Gēmu ni Tensei shita Heibon Reijō wa Seinaru Shishū no Ito o Sasu Bunssatsu-ban"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "en": "The Ordinary Noble Lady who was Reincarnated into an Unplayed Otome Game Stitches with Sacred Embroidery Thread"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "The Reincarnation Destination is... an Unplayed Otome Game!?\n\nElna, a plain viscount’s daughter, realizes at her academy’s entrance ceremony that she has been reincarnated into the world of the otome game Rainbow Paradise. However, since she has never played Rainbow Para before, the only information she has is the main characters’ appearances and the impressions her friend once shared.\n\nDetermined to live a quiet and uneventful life without drawing attention, her plans are soon derailed when she unexpectedly ends up interacting with the main prince and the stunningly beautiful heroine!\n\nThus begins a tantalizing love fantasy between a plain noble lady who loves embroidery and an excessively handsome but oblivious prince!"
  },
